{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他意识到自己和对方有时是彼此需要的，于是决定不再隐藏自己的喜欢。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"释然、欢喜、羞怯，隐约不安\",\n      \"missed\": \"对方以后是否还需要他、两人未必能一直亲近的担忧；欢喜逐渐变成心口发疼的复杂感受，以及夕阳、旧房子、梦醒等画面。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他终于相信彼此可能是需要对方的，也愿意承认自己的感情，不再刻意隐藏。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"欢喜、释然、心动、隐约害怕失去\",\n      \"missed\": \"得到满足之后仍然害怕亲近不能长久；欢喜和疼痛同时存在的情绪转折，以及后面三个关于夕阳、旧房子和梦醒的画面。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他不再为自己的喜欢道歉，决定坦然接受这份感情，但心里仍有对未来的顾虑。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"坦然、欢喜、珍惜、酸涩\",\n      \"missed\": \"他为什么会在高兴时感到心口发疼，以及从满足到害怕失去、最后突然落回现实的完整情绪变化。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"上方主体文字虽然字号很大，但整段连续铺开，没有把关键处境和情绪转折从长段落中凸显出来。第一眼容易抓到开头的彼此需要和侧栏高亮的“不再藏着喜欢”，却不容易同时抓到后面的核心矛盾：终于敢于喜欢，却也因为知道这份亲近未必长久而感到疼痛。右侧七条短语本身有前后递进关系，能够帮助串联，但字号较小、条数较多，而且与主体文字之间缺少明确的对应关系。整体不是内容彼此无关，而是故事主线容易抓到，复杂感受和画面之间的联系需要继续读才能完整建立。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "db4a9834-1355-49a2-a330-1894e02bfa99", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T010142230704Z", "elapsed_seconds": 64.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:02:46.533167+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f97093b82f9944e9adc75a3a9369fa726424447646cf1308142e37e11fdf83e6", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T010142230704Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "4849d7ee4c39aa5d948972f0d9387ee7fad485f9ebc1bcd49db5b9c85222afdc"}}}
